WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=sn.

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.762
Zvadaro, enda mberi kutarisa kumashure kweziso.

2
00:00:04.762 --> 00:00:10.928
Bata ophthalmoscope muruoko rwako rwerudyi kuti uongorore ziso rekurudyi uye zvichipesana.

3
00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:15.450
Tanga netsoka dzako pedyo nemurwere uye sendamira kumashure.

4
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.972
Kumbira murwere kuti agadzirise pane chakananga chinhambwe

5
00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:24.494
iyo yakatwasuka uye dzivisa kutarisa kuchiedza cheophthalmoscope.

6
00:00:24.494 --> 00:00:32.305
Zvishoma nezvishoma tanga kufamba kubva 10 kusvika 15 madhigirii temporal pane yakachinjika meridian ine zero simba lenzi.

7
00:00:32.305 --> 00:00:37.238
Chengetedza reflex tsvuku mukuona uye uende pedyo nemurwere.

8
00:00:37.238 --> 00:00:41.760
Iyo optic disc inofanira kuuya pakuonekwa kana iwe uchiramba

9
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.418
masendimita kure.

10
00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:46.040
Taura nezvekuti musiyano weiyo margin ye disc iri sei, iyo

11
00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:51.002
ruvara rweyeuro-retinal rim uye mukombe kune disc ratio.

12
00:00:51.002 --> 00:00:53.980
Kana iwe usingakwanise kuona disc,

13
00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:57.460
wobva wafamba uchienda kwakananga uko matavi emudziyo weretina.

14
00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:00.905
Izvi zvinokutungamirira kune disc.

15
00:01:00.905 --> 00:01:04.350
Mukuongorora uku tsinga yemaziso ndiyo

16
00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:04.659
kuzvimba.

17
00:01:04.659 --> 00:01:08.670
Mucheto hauna kujeka uye mukombe wepakati haupo nekuda kwekuve

18
00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:10.941
kuzadzwa netsinga yakazvimba yakakomberedza.

19
00:01:10.941 --> 00:01:13.590
Iyo yakanaka capillaries pamusoro pe

20
00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:17.192
tsinga yakavharika, sedzimwe dzetsinga dzakakura.

21
00:01:17.192 --> 00:01:18.830
Tsinga dzakazvimba uye

22
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.620
pane kubuda ropa kudiki kuriko na9 o'clock.

23
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.790
Zviratidzo izvi zvose zvinoenderana papillodema

24
00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:27.783
nekuda kwekukwira intracranial pressure.

25
00:01:27.783 --> 00:01:34.970
Iyi tsinga yemaziso ine muganho wakasarudzika,

26
00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:40.948
asi iyo neuroretinal rim yakacheneruka.

27
00:01:40.948 --> 00:01:46.072
Uku ndiko kutaridzika kwe optocatrophe.

28
00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:47.780
Mune izvi

29
00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:51.689
kuongorora mukombe wepakati wakawedzerwa nekutetepa kweuroretinal rim.

30
00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:52.340
Tsinga

31
00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:57.540
Nekuda kweizvozvo ine kapu yakawedzera kudhisiki reshiyo ye0.8, inokurudzira kwazvo kuvepo kwe

32
00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:57.980
glaucoma.
